From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Subject: [PATCH] asap7/coralnpu-exmem: an EX/MEM register in front of the
 load/store unit

ORFS #4653's commits after 0103, as one patch: surgery.py reads and
writes UTF-8; surgery.py --address-register registers LsuV1's inputs,
the EX/MEM register, in coralnpu-exmem (1,700 ps clock) and
coralnpu-regfile-exmem (1,650 ps); and the coralnpu README.

Not upstreamed: ORFS #4653 is a draft. Retires with the bump onto an
ORFS that has merged it.

---
